{"key": "[\"At Sanchi, Ashoka builds a stupa of brick, and beside it a pillar that warns the monks against schism. Later centuries double the mound, case it in stone and give it four carved gateways. One records the gift of Ananda, foreman of the artisans of King Satakarni. Of all a visitor sees, only the hidden core is Ashoka's.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/sanchi-stupa.mp3", "duration": 22.465958, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "At"}, {"t": 0.38734410344827586, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "Sanchi,"}, {"t": 0.7746882068965517, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "Ashoka"}, {"t": 1.1620323103448276, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "builds"}, {"t": 1.5493764137931034, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "a"}, {"t": 1.9367205172413793, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "stupa"}, {"t": 2.324064620689655, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "of"}, {"t": 2.711408724137931, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "brick,"}, {"t": 3.098752827586207, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "and"}, {"t": 3.4860969310344827, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "beside"}, {"t": 3.8734410344827586, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "it"}, {"t": 4.260785137931034, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "a"}, {"t": 4.64812924137931, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "pillar"}, {"t": 5.035473344827587, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "that"}, {"t": 5.422817448275862, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "warns"}, {"t": 5.810161551724137, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "the"}, {"t": 6.197505655172414, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "monks"}, {"t": 6.58484975862069, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "against"}, {"t": 6.972193862068965, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "schism."}, {"t": 7.359537965517241, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "Later"}, {"t": 7.746882068965517, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "centuries"}, {"t": 8.134226172413793, "d": 0.38734410344827586, "w": "double"}, {"t": 8.521570275862068, "d": 0.38734